title: Dashboard › Request drawer › Needs you and write-back boxes
route: /dashboard?request=I-2218
intro: The coloured box at the top of the drawer appears only when a person has something to do. There are three kinds: review a drafted answer, wait for the draft, and approve a write-back. The write-back box shows only while write-back is on in EMR Connect; when it is off, one calm line takes its place. Any other request shows no box.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Request drawer opens"
decision d1 "Is the stage Info requested?"
decision d2 "Has Packet finished the draft? (the request needs you)"
decision d3 "Is it an approval whose next step says 'Write-back'?"
endx x1 "No box\nThe drawer starts with the facts"

overlay b1 "Amber box 'Needs your input'\n'The payer asked for more information. Packet drafted the answer from the chart and Integrity checked it.'"
click c1 "Click 'Review the answer'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Answer a payer information request"

overlay b2 "Grey box 'Packet is drafting the answer'\n'Nothing for you to review yet. You will get a notification as soon as the draft is ready.'"
click c2 "Click 'Check on the draft'"
process p1 "Button shows a spinner for 1.3 seconds"
agent a1 "Packet finishes the draft"
store w1 "Request now needs you\nWhat happens next: 'Packet drafted the answer. Waiting for your review'"
store w2 "History gets 'Packet drafted the answer. Waiting for your review'"
toast t1 "'The draft is ready'\n'Packet finished the answer for I-2218. Review it, then sign and send.'"
process p2 "Box switches to 'Needs your input'\nThe table row shows the new next step"

decision d4 "Is write-back on for a connected system in EMR Connect?"
overlay b3 "Green box 'Approved. Write-back waits for you'\n'Cadence updated the ledger. The approval number and dates go to the EMR only after you confirm.'"
click c3 "Click 'Approve write-back'"
goto g2 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Approve the write-back"
overlay b4 "Calm line, no button\n'Write-back is off for your records system. Turn it on in EMR Connect.'"
click c4 "Click 'Turn it on in EMR Connect.'"
goto g3 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Connected systems › Read only or read and write back"
process p3 "The row's 'What happens next' and 'Held by' say 'Write-back is off in EMR Connect'\nTurning it on in EMR Connect brings the green box back"

group gSeed "Demo examples"
  process e1 "P-1499: draft ready\nNeeds your input"
  process e2 "I-2218 and R-0975: still drafting\nUse 'Check on the draft'"
  process e3 "R-0951: approved, write-back waiting"
  process e4 "A Received or Under review request: 'Asks for information' in Demo controls gives 'Needs your input' at once"
endgroup

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| d2
d1 -->|No| d3
d2 -->|Yes| b1 --> c1 --> g1
d2 -->|No| b2 --> c2 --> p1 --> a1 --> w1 --> w2 --> t1 --> p2
p2 --> b1
d3 -->|Yes| d4
d4 -->|Yes| b3 --> c3 --> g2
d4 -->|No| b4 --> c4 --> g3
b4 -.-> p3
d3 -->|No| x1
d2 -.-> e1
b2 -.-> e2
b3 -.-> e3
b1 -.-> e4
